"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>q</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span> under every valuation.</li>\n</ol>\n</div>","file":"ch04-semantics-soundness-completeness/04-valuations-and-truth-tables.html"}